  (text "[0] MODE Register - Cycle control\n=================================\n\n0 0 0 0  - RUN\n0 0 0 1  - STOP\n1 0 0 1  - Run one instruction cycle\n1 0 1 1  - Run one debug operation\nx 1 x x  - RESET\n      |--- DEBUG_STOP (stop the PC)\n    |----- DEBUG_MODE (0 = instruction, 1 = debug)\n  |------- DEBUG_RESET (global reset)\n|--------- DEBUG_REQX (trigger a debug cycle)\n\n"
    (at 17.78 54.61 0)
    (effects (font (face "Consolas") (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 3c46589a-c0ee-48f3-80b5-fd285799f226)
  )
  (text "[1] OP Register - Debug Operations\n================================================================\n0000000 x  - NOP\n0000001 i  - MEMRD (address in ADDR, set i for post increment)\n0000010 i  - MEMWR (address in ADDR, set i for post increment)\n0000011 i  - REGRD (address in ADDR)\n0000100 i  - REGWR (address in ADDR)\n0000101 i  - CCRD  (address in ADDR selects CCREGX)\n0000110 i  - PCRD  (address in ADDR selectd PCNEXTX)\n0000111 x  - INSTRD read the current instruction\n0001000 x  - ARGRD  read the argument at HERE\n        |\n        |---- DEBUG_INC\n-------\n   |--------- DEBUG_OP\n\nAddress increments happen on access to the data high-byte\nat the end of a read or write cycle"
    (at 57.15 46.99 0)
    (effects (font (face "Consolas") (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom))
