  )
  (text "Debug Registers\n=================================\n0 MODE - RUN / STOP / ISTEP / DSTEP\n1 OP   - Debug instruction\n2 DL   - Data Low Byte and DEBUG_ARGX\n3 DH   - Data High Byte\n4 AL   - Address Low Byte\n5 AH   - Address High Byte\n"
